Re-review this revised Swift L18 Apple computer-use executor. Focus on whether these prior findings are fixed: execution consent bound to approved dry-run plan digest, baseline trusted evidence requirement, structural request/plan validation, ASCII SHA256 evidence digest validation, and cancellation after backend.execute. Do not repeat stale findings outside the provided source. Return strict JSON with findings, residual_risks, testing_gaps.

